{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 24, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "\"Discovering Japan: A Journey of Culture and Wonder\n\nMy recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life. I spent my days exploring the bustling streets of Tokyo, marveling at the towering skyscrapers and neon lights that illuminate the city.\n\nBut it was the traditional aspects of Japan that truly stole my heart. I spent a peaceful afternoon strolling through the serene gardens of the Meiji Shrine, surrounded by beautiful cherry blossom trees and tranquil ponds. I was also fascinated by the ancient temples and shrines that dot the countryside, each one filled with intricate carvings and ornate details.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was experiencing a traditional Japanese tea ceremony, where I learned about the history and significance of this ancient ritual. The ceremony was a serene and meditative experience, and a great way to slow down and appreciate the beauty of the moment.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a journey of discovery and wonder. From the vibrant cities to the peaceful countryside, Japan is a country that has something to offer everyone. I left with a newfound appreciation for the culture and traditions of this fascinating country, and a strong desire to return someday.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.4636104106903076}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -0.009839840233325958}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.02975759096443653}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0004676678800024092}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -6.318072337307967e-06}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.03671655431389809}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.013708963990211487}, {"token": " Culture", "logprob": -2.1545331478118